WEBVTT

00:05.520 --> 00:07.400
Your Highness said push him down

00:07.480 --> 00:08.920
Can't you all hear?

00:12.080 --> 00:12.920
Your Highness

00:13.000 --> 00:14.880
His Majesty has given such generous terms

00:15.040 --> 00:16.040
Shouldn't we

00:16.120 --> 00:17.440
Just retreat back?

00:17.520 --> 00:18.640
Yes, Your Highness

00:18.720 --> 00:19.800
What did you say?

00:19.880 --> 00:21.280
Rebellion

00:21.400 --> 00:23.067
Do you want to rebel?

00:25.000 --> 00:26.040
Good sirs

00:26.120 --> 00:27.440
Good sirs

00:27.520 --> 00:29.320
Prince of Jin has defied the edict

00:29.400 --> 00:30.240
This will ruin

00:30.320 --> 00:31.720
All your futures

00:32.120 --> 00:33.720
Quickly seize him

00:33.800 --> 00:34.840
Quickly seize him

00:34.920 --> 00:37.587
Return to the capital with me for reward

00:39.520 --> 00:41.560
Your Highness, we fought battles for you

00:41.640 --> 00:42.960
Many brothers have died

00:43.040 --> 00:44.280
For the nation's great cause

00:44.360 --> 00:46.000
We can't let you continue making mistakes

00:46.160 --> 00:46.960
Brothers

00:47.040 --> 00:48.440
Tie up Your Highness

